{
 "id": "long02",
 "show": "FULL CLEAR",
 "label": "GUIDE",
 "title": "How to get rich early in GTA 6 (legit)",
 "episode": "Money guide · Nov 2026",
 "cast": {
  "Scout": {}
 },
 "lines": [
  [
   "Scout",
   "Broke in Leonida? Same."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Here are nine legit ways to get rich early in GTA Six."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "No glitches, no exploits, nothing that gets patched tomorrow."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Every spot in this video is pinned on our free map, link in the description."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Let's get paid."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number one: stop losing the money you already have."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "If you get wasted or busted, the cash in your pocket is gone."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "So before you have a bank account, stash it under the floorboards in Jason's bedroom."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "The bank app, BuckMe, unlocks in Chapter One."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "After that, deposit at any ATM. Boring? Yes."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "But it's the difference between rich and restarting."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number two: loot is not money yet."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Jewelry, electronics, all the stuff you grab in a robbery, has to be sold to a fence."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Different fences open up as you play, and some pay on the spot."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "So if your pockets are full of watches and your wallet is empty, that's why."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Find a fence, then celebrate."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number three: the raided warehouse in Hamlet."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "On the eastern edge of Hamlet there's a warehouse where, when you walk in, everyone is already down."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "No fight."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Just bags of cash, weapons, a safe with a collectible card inside, and vans parked right there."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Bring a car with a trunk, because you'll want to store the bags."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Loot every room and every body."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "In DPJ's run, a single stash bag held four thousand eight hundred dollars, and the whole place paid well over ten thousand."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "You can come here at any time."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number four: the tiger camp."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "East of Pelican Valley, near a small airstrip, there's a run-down camp."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "At night you'll hear gunshots, then a tiger. Yes, a tiger."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Let the fight play out from a safe distance."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "When it's over, the camp is yours: a few thousand in cash, and a legendary sniper rifle."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Two warnings."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Men may arrive by car, so stay alert."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "And the police can show up, so grab the rifle, put it in your own car's trunk, and leave."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number five: demolition derby at Ambrosia Raceway Park."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "This one is repeatable, and you can rent a car right at the track."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "The figure-eight pays roughly double the oval."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "If you like smashing cars more than robbing banks, this is your job now."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number six: hunting."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "From Chapter Two, Bret's hunting cabin in Mount Kalaga National Park buys the animals you bring in."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Throw them in the trunk, drive them to Bret, and take his bounty lists for bigger targets."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "It's quiet money."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Nobody calls the cops on a hunter."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number seven: treasure diving."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Off the coast of Key Lento there are shipwrecks on the sea floor."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "With scuba gear and a metal detector you can dig up artefacts, and Kenton buys them."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "It's slow, it's relaxing, and the Keys look incredible underwater."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number eight: sell the rare stuff."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Some safes and stashes hold collectible cards."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "DPJ found a rare one in the Hamlet warehouse safe, and says cards like that can be sold."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "If you're not collecting them, that's free money sitting in your inventory."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Number nine: stop wasting it."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "A RydeMe taxi is cheap, but skipping the ride costs a hundred dollars every time."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Registering a car to keep it costs real money too."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "In DPJ's game, keeping the green Fast and Furious sports car cost about six and a half thousand."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "So only register the cars you actually love. Quick recap. Bank your cash."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Sell loot to a fence."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Hit the Hamlet warehouse and the tiger camp early."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Then farm the derby, hunt for Bret, and dive for treasure."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Every location from this video is on our free interactive map at fullclearmap dot com, so you don't have to remember any of it."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Found a better money spot?"
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "Tell us in our Discord, and if it checks out, we'll pin it with your name on it."
  ],
  [
   "Scout",
   "This was Scout, from Full Clear. Go get rich."
  ]
 ],
